# {{lb|en|botany}} Any of several trees, of the [[genus]] ''[[Dracaena]]'', having a thick [[trunk]], [[sword]]-[[shaped]] [[leaves]] and [[orange]] [[fruit]], especially {{taxlink|Dracaena draco|species|noshow=1|ver=160930}}, of the [[Canary Islands]] – the source of [[dragon's blood]].

